  "emptyCanvasSuiteFooter": "EDACrux 产品套件成员之一 — edacrux.app",
  "@emptyCanvasSuiteFooter": {
    "description": "Suite-membership line at the foot of the empty-canvas (welcome) screen. The whole line is a link to the EDACrux suite site. \"edacrux.app\" must appear verbatim — the widget splits the sentence around it to underline the domain — but a translation that drops it still renders and is still followable, just without an underlined segment. \"EDACrux\" is one word and is never translated."
