    "description": "Section header above the three sibling-product rows at the foot of the empty-canvas (welcome) screen. Rendered upper-case in English as a small letter-spaced label, matching the \"RECENT FILES\" headers above it; a locale whose script has no case simply reads as a label. \"EDACrux\" is one word and is never translated."
  },
  "emptyCanvasPeerNetCrux": "看清信号背后的逻辑。从波形直接交叉探查到原理图，再返回。",
  "@emptyCanvasPeerNetCrux": {
    "description": "One line in the \"More from EDACrux\" section of the empty-canvas (welcome) screen, describing NetCrux to someone using WaveCrux. Written from THIS product's point of view on purpose — what NetCrux does for a WaveCrux user is not what it does for a user of another product — so do not reuse another repository's wording. Keep it to roughly one short sentence plus one more; the row wraps but is not a paragraph. Product names are never translated."
  },
  "emptyCanvasPeerLintCrux": "在仿真之前就发现问题。对生成此波形的 RTL 做 lint 和 CDC 检查。",
